OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 180 homes rejected over
OL,4,Ahighways fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build 180 homes on the edge of
OL,7,Fa Leicestershire village have been
OL,8,Frejected over concerns about extra
OL,9,Ftraffic.
OL,11,FDeveloper David Wilson Homes wanted to
OL,12,Fbuild the properties on 50.1 acres of
OL,13,Ffarmland south of London Road in Great
OL,14,FGlen.
OL,16,FHarborough District Council planning
OL,17,Fofficers had recommended the scheme be
OL,18,Fapproved but councillors voted to
OL,19,Frefuse a planning application when they
OL,20,Fmet on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
